      "channelId": "UCYzwGkfOqrevO-4TuTjPLwQ",
      "title": "The State of Enterprise Operations Security: Our Interview with Rob Lee",
      "description": "Rob Lee touches on the difference between enterprise IT Security and OT (operations technology) Security during our interview at RSA Conference 2020, yet underscores the importance of uniting the two -- not bifurcating the industry. Lee explains the far-reaching touchpoints of OT security and the potentially catastrophic situations that industrial security faces as a result of our increasingly connected world. He cautions that in light of all of this we shouldn't over-regulate to correct for this.\n\nRob Lee is a SANS Institute fellow and founder, and CEO at Dragos, Inc.",
