      "channelId": "UCYzwGkfOqrevO-4TuTjPLwQ",
      "title": "Humans are Resilient and Adaptive: Our Interview with Bruce Schneier",
      "description": "Humans are resilient, adaptive, and have a knack for figuring our way out of really bad problems. Bruce Schneier explains why these traits coupled with a security mindset gives us the special ability to make advancements not only to cyber security, but to society as a whole. He theorizes that security professionals have a unique perspective that could -- and should --  influence policy. \n\nSchneier also shares valuable tips for getting the most out of RSA Conference and all that it offers.\n\nBruce Schneier is an award-winning author, a world-renowned cryptographer and cybersecurity expert, and an RSA Conference veteran presenter.",
