      "title": "What SMBs Need to Know to Survive a Ransomware Attack",
      "description": "Presenters:\nKiersten Todt, President and Managing Partner, Liberty Group Ventures, Managing Director, The Cyber Readiness Institute\nTanya Janca, Founder, Security Trainer and Coach at SheHacksPurple.dev\n\nRansomware is disruptive and costly and can be catastrophic for some businesses…but it doesn’t have to be. In this webcast, focused on the cybersecurity needs for small to medium-sized businesses, industry leaders will walk you through the steps you can take (regardless of your budget) to ensure that your business survives a ransomware attack.\n\nhttps://www.rsaconference.com/industry-topics/webcast/42-smb-ransomware",
