      "title": "My Botnet Always Beats Yours: A Honeypot to Massive Bot Fight Scenes",
      "description": "Tan Kean Siong, Security Researcher, Independent\n\nThe IoT botnet universe is always the fascinating one. This session will share interesting threat hunting stories from a single honeypot to uncover various dramatic fight scenes of IoT botnet herders in the dark, such as botnet operators takeover and wipe out other's botnets, shared backdoored exploit scripts to their peers, constantly develop bots with evolving bot killing capabilities, etc. Pre-Requisites: General understanding of honeypot concept, botnet and IoT.",
